╭─am v0.0.╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─────────╮
│agent-mon│    j / k  ↑ / ↓  move                                                        │─────────│
│▌◑ featur│        home / G  top / bottom                                                │░░░ 121k │
│ ◐ fix/of│ ctrl-d / ctrl-u  page down / up                                              │░░░ 185k │
│         │           ← / →  fold / unfold the selected stack (▾ / ▸, clickable)         │         │
│gridsight│               ⏎  open (IDE; resumes last agent session)                      │─────────│
│ · main  │       g / l / p  open PR / Linear ticket / Linear project                    │         │
│         │               w  toggle log pane (Settings → View logs… opens the file)      │         │
│         │               n  new worktree                                                │         │
│         │         d / del  delete worktree (asks first)                                │         │
│         │             tab  focus the jobs pane                                         │         │
│         │  v / V / ctrl-v  PRs to review: page / beside the list / new window          │         │
│         │  t / T / ctrl-⏎  review page: pull into Reviewing / + run script             │         │
│         │               A  add repository                                              │         │
│         │           f / F  filter worktrees / filters on/off                           │         │
│         │               s  settings (Key bindings… changes these keys)                 │         │
│         │               r  refresh now (bypasses backoff)                              │         │
│         │               h  toggle help                                                 │         │
